<title>NEW ZEALAND: Wang NZ says AGM rejects final dividend.</title>
<headline>Wang NZ says AGM rejects final dividend.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wang New Zealand said on Friday its final dividend of 4.5 cents per share was not approved at the shareholders' meeting.  </p>
<p>Blue Star, which owns 98 percent of Wang, voted against the resolution.</p>
<p>Wang said that a special resolution on reregistration under the 1993 Companies Act was carried.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
